    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem abc.variants.quality (ε : ℝ) (hε : 0 < ε) :\n    {(a, b, c) : ℕ × ℕ × ℕ | 0 < a ∧ 0 < b ∧ 0 < c ∧ ({a, b, c} : Set ℕ).Pairwise Nat.Coprime ∧\n    a + b = c ∧ quality a b c > (1 + ε)}.Finite",
